{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14714","headline":"寄兴国池鹤上刘相公 · 张衆甫","name":"寄兴国池鹤上刘相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"驯狎经时久，䙰褷短翮存。\n不随淮海变，空媿稻粱恩。\n独立秋天静，单栖夕露繁。\n欲飞还敛翼，讵敢望乘轩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张衆甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14714.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14714","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}